{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wow your DJ shows, house parties, and events, with curated, pre-generated AI visuals and live fractals!</h2><br>The AI VJ app offers curated, <strong>pre-generated</strong> audio reactive AI visuals to <i>Wow your DJ shows</i>, house parties and events!<br><br>It is minimalistic VJ software that syncs visuals with your music using any live audio source, or the Ableton Link Protocol; for mesmerizing effects<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/6870eec58f1e9e95daa0dd447be75289.poster.avif?t=1772160208\" width=260 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/6870eec58f1e9e95daa0dd447be75289.webm?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/6870eec58f1e9e95daa0dd447be75289.mp4?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/7ed1c52fd4d78428498453bd8ada2996.poster.avif?t=1772160208\" width=260 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/7ed1c52fd4d78428498453bd8ada2996.webm?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/7ed1c52fd4d78428498453bd8ada2996.mp4?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/8fb52a0dc891947f332db5fa1c0cf46b.poster.avif?t=1772160208\" width=260 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/8fb52a0dc891947f332db5fa1c0cf46b.webm?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/8fb52a0dc891947f332db5fa1c0cf46b.mp4?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Working features already include:</h2><br>\u2013 Has great default settings that take care of the VJing for you. So you can focus on DJing again!<br>\u2013 Supports a projector (secondary screen), but can also be run on a single screen; clicking the full-screen icon hides the UI<br>\u2013 Use the Ableton Link Protocol to connect to Virtual DJ, Rekordbox, Traktor, Serato and other popular DJ software, for perfect sync<br>\u2013 Fallback to line-in input, microphone input, WASAPI, or native PC audio loopback to estimate BPM from any live audio source<br>\u2013 Usable with your own mp4 VJ videos / VJ loops collection<br>\u2013 Make picture slide-shows for special events by loading your own pictures onto a deck. Automatically audio synced!<br>\u2013 Easily re-arrange, and inter-mix visual clips, fractals and pictures through drag and dropping visuals, banks, decks and sets<br>\u2013 You can control AI-VJ using your keyboard and mouse. No VJ controller needed!<br><br>It's already close to being one of the easiest VJ programs to set up &amp; use<br><br>For DJs it's the best VJ software to quickly get going!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/45b7a4518ed863bc0c62fb61b74099c7.poster.avif?t=1772160208\" width=260 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/45b7a4518ed863bc0c62fb61b74099c7.webm?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/45b7a4518ed863bc0c62fb61b74099c7.mp4?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/bb9279ce4223fd0fe80d30d4aa30a9f8.poster.avif?t=1772160208\" width=260 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/bb9279ce4223fd0fe80d30d4aa30a9f8.webm?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/bb9279ce4223fd0fe80d30d4aa30a9f8.mp4?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/7288fd9a29ba6ade51c8aa962da9725b.poster.avif?t=1772160208\" width=260 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/7288fd9a29ba6ade51c8aa962da9725b.webm?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/7288fd9a29ba6ade51c8aa962da9725b.mp4?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oh, and it's completely FREE VJ software!</h2><br>Visuals beyond samples are released as paid DLC. Some non-core elements are, and will be DLCs, such as the Customize Your DJ Logo DLC, which allows you to customize your DJ logo for public DJ shows.<br><br>But other than that it's a fully functional &amp; completely free VJ app!<br><br>If you enjoy AI VJ and would like to support further development, you could consider buying DLCs","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2893580?t=1772160208","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772160208","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/2d5525f786c7ad8791bccb86417369852258a94b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772160208","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/2d5525f786c7ad8791bccb86417369852258a94b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772160208","categories":[{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wow your DJ shows, house parties, and events, with curated, pre-generated AI visuals and live fractals!</h2><br>The AI VJ app offers curated, <strong>pre-generated</strong> audio reactive AI visuals to <i>Wow your DJ shows</i>, house parties and events!<br><br>It is minimalistic VJ software that syncs visuals with your music using any live audio source, or the Ableton Link Protocol; for mesmerizing effects<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/6870eec58f1e9e95daa0dd447be75289.poster.avif?t=1772160208\" width=260 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/6870eec58f1e9e95daa0dd447be75289.webm?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/6870eec58f1e9e95daa0dd447be75289.mp4?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/7ed1c52fd4d78428498453bd8ada2996.poster.avif?t=1772160208\" width=260 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893580/extras/7ed1c52fd4d78428498453bd8ada2996.webm?t=1772160208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so